# Commands

All backend commands run from a Frappe bench (`~/frappe-bench`), not from the repo root.

## Setup
```sh
bench get-app <repo-url>                 # add app to bench
bench --site <site> install-app healthcare
bench --site <site> migrate              # applies patches.txt + schema
```

## Tests (same as CI)
```sh
bench --site test_site run-parallel-tests --app healthcare
bench --site <site> run-tests --app healthcare --doctype "Patient Appointment"   # single doctype
```

## Lint and format
```sh
pip install pre-commit && pre-commit install
npm install            # eslint deps for the eslint hook
pre-commit run --all-files   # ruff, ruff-format, prettier, eslint, detect-secrets, pip-audit

git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/frappe/semgrep-rules.git .frappe-semgrep-rules
semgrep ci --config ./.frappe-semgrep-rules/rules --config r/python.lang.correctness
```

## Frontend (patient portal)
```sh
yarn install           # root postinstall installs patient_portal
yarn build             # = cd patient_portal && vite build --base=/assets/healthcare/patient_portal/
cd patient_portal && yarn dev   # Vite dev server with frappe proxy
```

## Translations
```sh
bench generate-pot-file --app healthcare   # regenerates healthcare/locale/main.pot
```
